    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scary Teacher 3D puts you in the role of a mischievous student determined to outsmart your terrifying scary teacher, Miss T, by setting up hilarious pranks in her house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay Highlights:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore &amp; Prank: Navigate a detailed 3D environment, find clues, and execute creative traps to annoy Miss T.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay Stealthy: Avoid detection as Miss T patrols, sets traps, and locks doors to catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve Puzzles: Use logic and timing to complete tasks and unlock new pranks across different levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic Challenges: Each level introduces fresh obstacles  keeping you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Laugh &amp; Strategize: Experience the thrill of suspense mixed with humor as you watch Miss T\u2019s over-the-top reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With engaging puzzles, unpredictable challenges, and endless pranking fun, Scary Teacher 3D delivers a unique mix of strategy, humor, and stealth action. Can you stay ahead of the Scary Teacher?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scary Teacher 3D puts you in the role of a mischievous student determined to outsmart your terrifying scary teacher, Miss T, by setting up hilarious pranks in her house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay Highlights:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore &amp; Prank: Navigate a detailed 3D environment, find clues, and execute creative traps to annoy Miss T.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay Stealthy: Avoid detection as Miss T patrols, sets traps, and locks doors to catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve Puzzles: Use logic and timing to complete tasks and unlock new pranks across different levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic Challenges: Each level introduces fresh obstacles  keeping you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Laugh &amp; Strategize: Experience the thrill of suspense mixed with humor as you watch Miss T\u2019s over-the-top reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With engaging puzzles, unpredictable challenges, and endless pranking fun, Scary Teacher 3D delivers a unique mix of strategy, humor, and stealth action. Can you stay ahead of the Scary Teacher?</p>",
